# Casualty_Driver_Age_Difference_Abs
# Feature description: Absolute difference between Age_of_Driver and Age_of_Casualty.
# Usefulness: This feature captures the absolute age gap between the driver and casualty, emphasizing the intergenerational dynamics without focusing on direction of difference. It may reveal patterns in accident circumstances influenced by driver demographics.
df['Casualty_Driver_Age_Difference_Abs'] = abs(df['Age_of_Driver'] - df['Age_of_Casualty'])
end

