# Casualty_Severity_Normalized
# Feature description: Normalizes Casualty_IMD_Decile to scale its values between 0 and 1 for consistent modeling and analysis.
# Usefulness: Simplifies representation of socioeconomic impact in accidents, enabling easier comparisons and revealing patterns linked to driver sex.
df['Casualty_Severity_Normalized'] = (df['Casualty_IMD_Decile'] - df['Casualty_IMD_Decile'].min()) / (
    df['Casualty_IMD_Decile'].max() - df['Casualty_IMD_Decile'].min())
end

