# Driver_Economic_Area_Ratio
# Feature description: Calculates the ratio between Casualty_IMD_Decile and Local_Authority_(District) to understand how socioeconomic factors interact with regional accident data.
# Usefulness: This feature can reveal the economic disparity and its effect on the circumstances of accidents, which could correlate with driver sex.
df['Driver_Economic_Area_Ratio'] = df['Casualty_IMD_Decile'] / (df['Local_Authority_(District)'] + 1e-5)  # Add small epsilon to avoid division by zero.
end

